<br>
<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Hakeem</span> reaches into his pocket and pulls out his wallet, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Here you go, as promised. Thanks again. If you want, I’m sure he’d love to have you babysit next week too, same time. No worries if not, but I’m guessing he likes you more than the normal babysitter. Just stop by around the same time and let us know.”</span> He gives you a smile and wave, putting his things away as you thank him and walk towards the door.  <br>
